Third-party code
----------------
This repository also vendors, forks or links third-party code, mostly under
models/, methods/ and metrics/ (for example metrics/rigis/vggt_omega and the
metrics/WorldScore submodule). That code keeps its own upstream license and is NOT
relicensed under Apache-2.0. Every component, its license and the location of its
license file are listed in docs/THIRD_PARTY.md.

Non-commercial components
-------------------------
Some components that the full benchmark pipeline depends on are licensed for
non-commercial use only:
  - VGGT-Omega (RIGIS backbone): FAIR Noncommercial Research License
  - DINOv3 weights (KIVA reader backbone): DINOv3 License
  - pyiqa / CLIP-IQA+ (Visual Integrity): PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0
The complete pipeline is therefore effectively usable for non-commercial research
only, even though RoboWorM's own code is Apache-2.0.

Components without an upstream license
--------------------------------------
FasterCache (methods/cache_strategy/FasterCache/) and SiTo (methods/prunning/SiTo/)
are vendored from upstream repositories that declare no license. They are included
for research reproducibility only; contact their authors before any other use.

Data and model weights
----------------------
Datasets and benchmark rollouts published on Hugging Face follow the licenses of
their source corpora (DROID, RoboChallenge, AIST Bimanual, RoboCOIN, GR00T Teleop
GR1). Model weights are not part of this repository and follow their own licenses
(see checkpoints/CHECKPOINTS.md).
